I was thinking about a possible reference to Funke's Inkheart-books (I'm 
not sure how popular they are, especially in non-German-speaking 
countries, though).

Upon reading a spellbook, there could be a small chance of creating a 
random monster, possibly peacheful/tame (and maybe only weak ones, so 
this does not open a hole for getting pets easily), or small amounts of 
gems/glass/gold.  Maybe this could be connected to the time spent 
